<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#FFFFFF', padding: 0, position: 'relative', fontFamily: 'PingFang SC' }}>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', top: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 64, background: '#1E4FA8' }} />
  <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 21, fontSize: 15, color: '#C9D8EF', letterSpacing: 1 }}>知迹 · 答辩汇报</Text>
  <Text style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 1010, top: 21, width: 194, textAlign: 'right', fontSize: 15, color: '#C9D8EF' }}>03 · 关键实现 ③ 质量门禁</Text>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 92, width: 1128 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 31, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>0.05 的容差，把「感觉变差」变成「命令失败」</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15.5, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 10 }}>三道门禁覆盖代码、检索、意图；每次改动跑同一份考卷，掉出容差即非零退出</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 186, width: 1128, height: 36, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#1E4FA8', borderRadius: 6, paddingLeft: 14 }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', width: 210 }}>门禁</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', width: 250 }}>测什么</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', width: 160 }}>规模</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF', width: 480 }}>不通过时</Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 226, width: 1128, height: 138, flexDirection: 'column' }}>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', height: 46, alignItems: 'center', borderBottom: '1px solid #E5E7EB', paddingLeft: 14 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', width: 210 }}>代码自测</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#4A5568', width: 250 }}>模块行为、级联删除、边界条件</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#1E4FA8', width: 160 }}>284 项</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#4A5568', width: 480 }}>断言失败即报错；全部离线，零 API 消耗</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', height: 46, alignItems: 'center', borderBottom: '1px solid #E5E7EB', paddingLeft: 14 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', width: 210 }}>检索考卷</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#4A5568', width: 250 }}>命中率与排序质量（Hit@3 / MRR）</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#1E4FA8', width: 160 }}>35 题 / 21 篇</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#4A5568', width: 480 }}>掉出容差 0.05 → 命令返回 1，可接入提交前检查</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', height: 46, alignItems: 'center', paddingLeft: 14 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230', width: 210 }}>意图考卷</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#4A5568', width: 250 }}>分类准确率（讲解/练习/规划…）</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#1E4FA8', width: 160 }}>15 句</Text>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#4A5568', width: 480 }}>同上；错分即视为回归</Text>
    </Box>

  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 380, width: 700, height: 168, flexDirection: 'column' }}>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, color: '#3D7BD9', letterSpacing: 1.5 }}>当前实测结果（口径见页脚）</Text>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', marginTop: 12 }}>

      <Box style={{ width: 160, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1 }}>0.9714</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 6 }}>检索 Hit@3</Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ width: 160, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1 }}>0.9714</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 6 }}>检索 MRR</Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ width: 160, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1 }}>1.0000</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 6 }}>意图准确率</Text>
      </Box>

      <Box style={{ width: 180, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#12A594', lineHeight: 1 }}>35 / 35</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#4A5568', marginTop: 6 }}>接真实向量时</Text>
      </Box>

    </Box>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.7, marginTop: 14 }}>
      消融：关闭精排后 MRR 由 0.9714 降至 0.9571（命中数不变），说明该层改善的是排序而非召回。
    </Text>

  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 808, top: 380, width: 396, height: 168, flexDirection: 'column', borderLeft: '3px solid #D9534F', paddingLeft: 14 }}>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A2230' }}>为什么不用大模型判分</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 12.5, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.75, marginTop: 8 }}>
      同一模型既写又评会共享盲区：它看不见的错误，复核时也看不见，甚至会把好答案改坏。
      所以判据用「确定性比对」：命中的是哪一篇、分到的是哪一类，都能机器校验；模型的判断只用于人工抽检。
    </Text>

  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, top: 568, width: 1128, height: 46, background: '#0E3F8C', borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13.5, color: '#FFFFFF' }}>
      口径：检索评测使用确定性词面向量（同一版本任何人复跑结果一致）；真实语义效果由接真模型的验证单独确认
    </Text>
  </Box>

  <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', left: 76, bottom: 24, width: 1128, height: 22, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#8B97A8' }}>知迹 · 基于大模型智能体的 AI 教育学习系统</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>08 / 11</Text>
  </Box>

</Slide>
